                                                "sense_id": "3125646f-038d-3cc9-b880-e522873ea1c5",
                                                "text": "Put slightly more colorfully, if a player left a strategy with his or her lawyer before the game began, the lawyer could play the game for the player without ever needing further instructions as to how to play."
